  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot project for Community Based Management of Severe Acute Malnutrition (CMAM) in Odisha.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Pilot project for Community Based Management of Severe Acute Malnutrition (CMAM) in Odisha. is a component of Orissa Health Sector Nutrition Programme (OHSNP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;749,949. It works in the following sector(s): Basic nutrition, Basic health care.</narrative>
  </description>
